            "description" : "Emergency phone: Contacts that can be used in case of an accident or trouble, e.g. the supplier’s own emergency phone or the phone number to an official advisory body. A Poison Information Center gives advice and instruction regarding treatment of acute poisoning caused by chemicals etc.",
