            } ]
          },
          "exposureRoutePhrase" : {
            "description" : "For Specific Target Organ Toxicity (STOT), the entry can be limited to a way of exposure (e.g. inhalation). Although there is currently no known case with more than one route of exposure, we cannot exclude this biologically and thus technically.",
