            "description" : "Reactivity description: The reactivity hazards of the chemical shall be described. Specific test data shall be provided where available. Information may also be based on general data for the class or family of substance or mixture if such data adequately represent the anticipated hazard.If data for mixtures are not available, data on substances in the mixture shall be provided.",
