      "Sumi" : {
        "description" : "Safe Use Information for Mixtures. Based on a draft prepared by Qualisys GmbH, Langenfeld, Germany, and published under CC license BY-SA 4.0 during the BDI workshop in Berlin, 26 October 2016. Includes information from the presentation of Martin Kops at ENES 8 and other documents.",
